#
# Used instead of the root .dockerignore for Dockerfile.client. Both build from the project root, and the
# root file admits only what the published image needs, which leaves out everything this client COPYs
# from docker/tls. Admit exactly those files, so the context stays as small as the root file keeps it.
*
!target/midgie.jar
!docker/tls/ca.crt
!docker/tls/desired.xml
!docker/tls/run-tls-tests.sh
